- version 1.23.3b-1 (revert from 1.23.4b)
- Upstream retracted the 1.23.4b release within ~90 minutes of
  publishing it: git tag, GitHub release and release asset all
  deleted (releases/latest back to 1.23.3b, Source0 URL 404s as of
  2026-10-21 12:33 UTC), so any future OBS service run would fail to
  re-fetch Source0. Revert to the last live release; update.sh now
  detects upstream retractions (revert) and refuses to downgrade on a
  lagging releases/latest pointer (HOLD).

